    "description": "Complete API collection for the Lost & Found Portal backend.\n\n## Test Credentials\n- **ADMIN:** admin@campus.edu / admin123\n- **USER 1:** john@campus.edu / user123\n- **USER 2:** jane@campus.edu / user123\n- **USER 3:** bob@campus.edu / user123\n\n## Setup\n1. Run `npm run seed` to populate the database\n2. Import this collection into Postman\n3. Start with the Auth folder to login and get a token",
